@startuml selma_conflict_resolution
' ============================================================
' Selma — Conflict Resolution State Machine
' Source:  SPECIFICATION.md §2.15, §2.15.1, §2.15.2
'          User_Stories.md S-05, S-28
' C4:      Conflict Resolver
'          artifacts → Snapshots Adapter → artifact_store
'          denials → Findings & Audit Trail Adapter → event_store
' Contract: 8.2.4
'
' Precedence (normative, lower priority_level wins):
'   1. Explicit override (always_wins / never_wins / defer_to)
'   2. Compatible dual overrides (compatible_overrides)
'   3. Priority: constitutional=1 > statutory=2 > regulatory=3
'                > operational=4 > advisory=5
'   4. Specificity (higher score wins)
'   5. Recency (newer created_at wins; frozen in node_body)
'   6. Conflict Artifact → human conflict.resolve
' Within-lineage = binding. Cross-lineage = advisory only.
' Ownership / events: README.md
' ============================================================

title Selma — Conflict Resolution FSM\n<size:12><i>Deterministic cascade · binding within-lineage · advisory cross-lineage · human artifact path</i></size>

!include ./common/sm_styles.puml

[*] --> DetectPair : <b>detect</b>\nactor: System (Compiler | Rule Inspector)\ncommand: consistency review | multi-rule fire\non frozen CG-IR\nevent: ConflictDetectionStarted\nstory: S-05 / S-28

state "Detect\nConflicting Pair" as DetectPair #B9770E : **entry** scan conflicts_with or\noutcome contradiction\n(same lineage, both Fail,\ncontradictory deontics)\n**allowed** pair classify only\n**forbidden** mutate findings
state "No Conflict" as NoConflict #2C6E49 : **entry** no pair / both Pass\nPass+Fail / same-type Fail\n**allowed** terminal no-op\n**forbidden** artifact creation
state "Scope Check" as ScopeCheck #1B7A6E : **entry** compare lineage_id\n**allowed** branch binding vs advisory\n**forbidden** cross-lineage bind

state "1. Explicit\nOverride" as ExplicitOverride #1B7A6E : **entry** always_wins | never_wins |\ndefer_to (execution id)\n**allowed** single override win\n**forbidden** self-ref defer_to (fall through)\ncycles (DFS) → ignore all defer_to
state "2. Compatible\nOverrides" as CompatibleOverrides #1B7A6E : **entry** compatible_overrides()\nsymmetric pairs or identical defer_to\n**allowed** resolve or fall through\n**forbidden** partial bind on dual conflict
state "3. Priority" as PriorityCheck #1B7A6E : **entry** lower priority_level wins\n1 constitutional … 5 advisory\n**allowed** strict winner or tie advance
state "4. Specificity" as SpecificityCheck #1B7A6E : **entry** score = scope×100 + bound_fields\n**allowed** strict winner or tie advance
state "5. Recency" as RecencyCheck #1B7A6E : **entry** newer created_at wins\nfrozen in node_body\n**allowed** strict later or artifact on identical ts
state "Resolved\nBinding" as ResolvedBinding #2C6E49 : **entry** winner recorded · loser adjusted\n**allowed** terminal bind on frozen CG-IR\n**forbidden** rewrite CG-IR nodes
state "Conflict Artifact\nPending" as ArtifactPending #A93226 : **entry** requires human resolve\n**allowed** escalate to Official\n**forbidden** auto-bind

state "Human Review" as HumanReview #B9770E : **entry** Official reviews artifact\n**allowed** resolve | deny/defer\n**forbidden** unauthenticated resolve
state "Artifact\nResolved" as ArtifactResolved #2C6E49 : **entry** decision on same frozen snapshot\n**allowed** archive\n**forbidden** silent CG-IR rewrite
state "Artifact\nRejected" as ArtifactRejected #A93226 : **entry** no change · remains open\n**allowed** reopen review\n**forbidden** partial resolution write
state "Artifact\nArchived" as ArtifactArchived #4A4A4A : **entry** immutable retention **terminal**\n**allowed** read-only audit\n**forbidden** mutate decision

state "Run Precedence\nRead-Only" as AdvisoryCascade #1B7A6E : **entry** same cascade · no binding mutation\n**allowed** advisory signal only\n**forbidden** finding FSM / CG-IR write
state "Advisory\nArtifact" as AdvisoryArtifact #B9770E : **entry** binding_status=advisory\nrequires_human_action=true\n**allowed** human directive change → recompile\n**forbidden** auto-mutate findings/CG-IR
state "No Advisory" as NoAdvisory #2C6E49 : **entry** no residual cross-lineage signal\n**allowed** terminal

DetectPair --> NoConflict : <b>no candidate</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictNone
DetectPair --> ScopeCheck : <b>candidate pair</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictPairDetected
NoConflict --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

ScopeCheck --> ExplicitOverride : <b>same lineage_id</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: enter binding cascade\nevent: ConflictBindingScope
ScopeCheck --> AdvisoryCascade : <b>different lineage_id</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: enter advisory cascade\nevent: ConflictAdvisoryScope

ExplicitOverride --> ResolvedBinding : <b>single override wins</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictResolvedBinding\naction: winner recorded
ExplicitOverride --> CompatibleOverrides : <b>none / dual / ambiguous</b>\nactor: System\n[multi-active post-fork defer_to → Artifact path via cascade]\nevent: ConflictOverrideFallthrough

CompatibleOverrides --> ResolvedBinding : <b>compatible pair</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictResolvedBinding
CompatibleOverrides --> ArtifactPending : <b>incompatible dual</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictArtifactOpened
CompatibleOverrides --> PriorityCheck : <b>no override</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictFallthroughPriority

PriorityCheck --> ResolvedBinding : <b>strict winner</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictResolvedBinding
PriorityCheck --> SpecificityCheck : <b>tie</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictFallthroughSpecificity

SpecificityCheck --> ResolvedBinding : <b>strict winner</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictResolvedBinding
SpecificityCheck --> RecencyCheck : <b>tie</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictFallthroughRecency

RecencyCheck --> ResolvedBinding : <b>later created_at</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictResolvedBinding
RecencyCheck --> ArtifactPending : <b>identical timestamp</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictArtifactOpened

ResolvedBinding --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

ArtifactPending --> HumanReview : <b>escalate</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: open human review queue\nevent: ConflictReviewOpened
HumanReview --> ArtifactResolved : <b>conflict.resolve</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: conflict.resolve]\nevent: ConflictArtifactResolved\naction: decision recorded on frozen snapshot
HumanReview --> ArtifactRejected : <b>deny / defer</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: conflict.resolve]\nevent: ConflictArtifactRejected\naction: denial audit · artifact stays open
ArtifactResolved --> ArtifactArchived : <b>archive</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictArtifactArchived
ArtifactRejected --> HumanReview : <b>reopen review</b>\nactor: Regulatory Official\n[capability: conflict.resolve]\nevent: ConflictReviewReopened
ArtifactArchived --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

AdvisoryCascade --> AdvisoryArtifact : <b>conflict signal</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictAdvisoryEmitted
AdvisoryCascade --> NoAdvisory : <b>no residual conflict</b>\nactor: System\nevent: ConflictAdvisoryNone
AdvisoryArtifact --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none
NoAdvisory --> [*] : <b>terminal</b>\nactor: System\ncommand: sink\nevent: none

@enduml
